; One variable: partial alpha, against the hard alpha of `unit-gltf-alpha-border`. `soft-alpha-disc.png`
; is a green disc with a three-texel alpha ramp inside transparent magenta texels. Godot 4.6.3 gives
; each texel below alpha 20 the RGB of its nearest opaque neighbour, so at scale 20 the linear
; filter blends into green. A texel the pass missed fringes magenta.

